UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Cut from warm brushed cotton with a soft, slightly napped surface, this check shirt belongs to the cooler half of the year — autumn walks, cold spring mornings, anything that calls for a layer rather than a full coat. It works worn open over a plain tee for a relaxed weekend look, or buttoned up with dark jeans and boots for a casual dinner out. The blue and black check sits easily next to denim, grey knitwear and neutral outerwear. The overall feeling is unfussy and dependable rather than dressy.$desc$ WHERE id = 1;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A soft cotton jersey tee with a printed graphic, made for the kind of days spent at a desk, at a keyboard or out with friends. Light enough for summer on its own and easy to layer under a hoodie or an open shirt when it cools down. It pairs naturally with joggers, cargo trousers or straight jeans and a pair of sneakers. The mood is casual, a little bit gaming and streetwear, and not intended for anything formal.$desc$ WHERE id = 2;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A brushed plaid shirt with the cosy, flannel-like hand feel that makes it a natural choice for autumn and winter. It layers well over a t-shirt or under a jacket, and it holds up equally as a stay-at-home comfort shirt or a casual out-and-about one. Straight jeans, chinos and boots are its usual companions, and the plaid pattern keeps the styling simple. The vibe is rugged, laid-back and easy to live in.$desc$ WHERE id = 3;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A lightweight woven cotton shirt with short sleeves, made for hot weather, holidays and long evenings outdoors. It is breathable enough for the middle of summer yet neat enough to pass as smart casual for a relaxed office, a summer date or a dinner on a terrace. It goes with chinos, linen trousers or light denim, and with loafers or clean sneakers. The overall look is polished but never stiff.$desc$ WHERE id = 4;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A mid-weight cotton shirt in a classic check that carries across the whole year — sleeves rolled up in warm months, layered under a knit or jacket when it turns cold. It is the sort of shirt that works for a relaxed office, a family gathering or a casual weekend without needing to be rethought. It sits well with chinos, dark denim and simple leather shoes. The style is smart, versatile and quietly conventional.$desc$ WHERE id = 5;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A leather high-top basketball sneaker in bold red and black, equally at home on the court and on the street. The padded ankle and cushioned sole make it comfortable for long days on your feet, from city walking to casual sport. It anchors a streetwear look with joggers, wide jeans or shorts, and the strong colour block does the talking so the rest of the outfit can stay plain. The vibe is confident, sporty and unmistakably sneaker-culture.$desc$ WHERE id = 6;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Purpose-built baseball footwear with a studded outsole designed to grip loose dirt and grass during games and training. The supportive upper and secure lacing keep the foot stable through quick starts, stops and lateral movement. These belong on the field with team kit rather than in an everyday outfit, and they suit anyone playing regularly or joining a club. The character here is functional and performance-driven rather than fashionable.$desc$ WHERE id = 7;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A retro-shaped trainer with a soft foam sole and a mixed textile and synthetic upper, built around comfort for everyday walking. It handles commuting, errands and long city days without fuss, and it stays comfortable across the seasons. Jeans, joggers, shorts and casual trousers all work with it, and it reads as a low-effort finishing touch to a relaxed outfit. The mood is nostalgic sportswear updated for daily wear.$desc$ WHERE id = 8;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A lightweight running-style sneaker with a breathable mesh upper in off-white, cut through with red accents. The flexible cushioned sole is aimed at active use — gym sessions, light training, long days of movement — and the airy construction suits warm weather. It slots easily into sportswear with shorts, leggings or track pants. The overall impression is fast, energetic and gym-ready.$desc$ WHERE id = 9;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A chunkier lifestyle take on the off-white and red sneaker, with a thicker sole and more structured panelling that gives it visual weight. This one leans towards casual street styling rather than training, holding its shape well under jeans, cargo trousers or a tracksuit. It suits weekend outings, travel days and relaxed meetups where comfort matters but the shoe is still part of the look. The feeling is bold and modern without being loud.$desc$ WHERE id = 10;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A dress watch built around a genuine leather strap and a clean, uncluttered dial, with the warm brown leather softening the formality of the piece. It suits the office, meetings, a wedding or a dinner where a quiet detail matters more than a statement. It sits naturally under a shirt cuff and pairs well with a brown belt and leather shoes. This one appeals to someone who prefers understated classics over sporty or oversized watches.$desc$ WHERE id = 11;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A refined dress watch with a polished case and a restrained, well-proportioned dial, made for occasions where the details are noticed. It works for formal events, business settings and anniversaries, and it carries the weight of a milestone gift rather than an everyday purchase. Worn with a suit, a tailored jacket or a crisp shirt, it finishes the look without competing with it. The character is elegant, traditional and quietly expensive-feeling.$desc$ WHERE id = 12;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A classic dress watch with a black dial and a date window, framed by a polished metal case that keeps the whole thing sharp and legible. The dark dial makes it easy to wear with formal black tailoring as well as everyday business clothing. It suits boardrooms, evening events and the kind of occasion where a watch is the only jewellery worn. This is a piece for someone drawn to timeless, conservative elegance.$desc$ WHERE id = 13;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A dress watch with a moon phase complication, where a small aperture on the dial adds a touch of craft and detail to an otherwise clean face. It belongs with formal wear — evening events, celebrations, occasions worth marking — and works as a significant gift. Worn with a suit or a jacket and shirt, it rewards a closer look rather than announcing itself from across the room. The appeal is for collectors and anyone who values horological detail.$desc$ WHERE id = 14;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A versatile metal-bracelet watch with a date window, sitting comfortably between formal and everyday wear. It handles the office, a dinner, a wedding and a normal weekday with the same ease, which makes it a sensible single-watch choice. The bracelet works with both casual shirts and tailoring, and the balanced proportions keep it from feeling heavy on the wrist. The overall feeling is classic, dependable and endlessly wearable.$desc$ WHERE id = 15;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A sturdy steel sports watch in the diving tradition, with a rotating bezel, a bracelet and a robust case built for real use. It suits travel, outdoor activity and warm-weather wear, but it also carries well under a shirt for smart casual settings. It pairs naturally with jeans, chinos and casual jackets, and it looks at home on holiday as much as at the office. The mood is adventurous and masculine without being flashy.$desc$ WHERE id = 16;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A floor-length black evening gown in a fluid, softly draping fabric that follows the body and moves with it. It is made for formal nights — weddings, galas, receptions, anniversaries — where the dress code asks for something serious. Simple jewellery, heels and a small clutch are all it needs, since the silhouette carries the look on its own. The feeling is elegant, understated and confidently grown-up.$desc$ WHERE id = 17;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A structured leather corset paired with a matching skirt, with the firm, slightly glossy surface of leather shaping the whole silhouette. This is evening and night-out territory — parties, clubs, concerts, photoshoots — rather than daytime wear, and it suits mild to cool weather when a jacket can go over the top. Heeled boots and minimal jewellery keep the focus where it should be. The mood is bold, edgy and deliberately attention-catching.$desc$ WHERE id = 18;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A fitted corset top worn with a classic black skirt, combining a structured bodice with softer, easier-moving fabric below. It fits evening plans, dinners, birthdays and dressed-up nights out, and the black skirt keeps it grounded enough to restyle with other pieces. A cropped jacket or blazer over the top makes it work in cooler weather or a more restrained setting. The overall style is chic, coordinated and fashion-conscious without going too far.$desc$ WHERE id = 19;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A light, easy-wearing dress in a soft printed fabric, made for warm days and relaxed plans. It works for coffee with friends, market mornings, holidays and casual summer occasions where comfort comes first. Flat sandals or sneakers keep it everyday, while a denim jacket or cardigan extends it into cooler evenings. The vibe is playful, uncomplicated and cheerful.$desc$ WHERE id = 20;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A tailored suit in red and black, with a crisp jacket and matching trousers that hold a sharp line through the shoulder and leg. It suits work environments where personality is welcome, along with events, presentations and evenings that call for something dressed but not conventional. A plain top underneath and simple heels or loafers let the colour combination lead. The character is modern, confident and creative rather than corporate-safe.$desc$ WHERE id = 21;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A roomy everyday handbag in a strong blue, with several internal compartments that keep a phone, wallet and the usual daily clutter separated. It carries well for work, errands, travel days and city outings where a small bag simply is not enough. The colour acts as an accent piece against neutral clothing — black, grey, denim, camel. It suits someone who wants their bag to be practical first and decorative second.$desc$ WHERE id = 22;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A leather handbag with a substantial, well-finished feel and a shape that holds up rather than slouching. It moves easily between the office, meetings, dinners and weekend use, which makes it a sensible choice for someone who prefers to own one good bag. It reads well with tailoring, knitwear and coats, and the leather ages into character over time. The impression is refined, grown-up and quietly luxurious.$desc$ WHERE id = 23;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A designer handbag with clean lines, precise finishing and a visible logo, made to be recognised as the focal point of an outfit. It suits evenings, events, city days and occasions where the bag is meant to be seen, and it works as a serious gift. Kept alongside simple clothing in neutral tones, it does all the work by itself. The feeling is polished, status-aware and unapologetically luxurious.$desc$ WHERE id = 24;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A faux leather backpack in clean white, with enough room for a laptop, notebook and the things a full day requires. It fits study, commuting, travel and casual outings, giving hands-free practicality without the sporty look of a technical bag. It pairs neatly with jeans, casual dresses and sneakers, and the pale colour keeps outfits feeling light. The mood is modern, practical and easy-going.$desc$ WHERE id = 25;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A black handbag with a straightforward shape and a finish that stays neutral against almost anything in the wardrobe. It handles work, dinners, family occasions and everyday errands equally, which makes it the default choice on days when there is no time to think. It works with tailoring, coats, dresses and casual clothes without needing to be considered. The appeal is timeless, low-risk and endlessly practical.$desc$ WHERE id = 26;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Earrings set with a clear green crystal that catches light against a slim metal setting. They belong with dressed-up looks — weddings, formal dinners, celebrations — where a small bright detail near the face lifts the whole outfit. They work particularly well alongside black, deep green or neutral clothing, and pair best with hair worn up or back. They make an easy gift for someone who prefers elegant jewellery over bold statement pieces.$desc$ WHERE id = 27;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Earrings built around an oval green stone in a metal frame, with a shape that feels contemporary rather than traditional. They cross over comfortably from office days to evening plans, which makes them a practical everyday piece as well as a dressy one. Simple clothing in neutral colours lets the green read clearly, and they sit well with other minimal jewellery. The character is versatile, modern and quietly distinctive.$desc$ WHERE id = 28;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Colourful earrings with a lively tropical-inspired design that brings movement and brightness to a look. They suit holidays, summer parties, festivals and warm-weather occasions where the outfit is allowed to have fun. Plain dresses, linen shirts and simple tops give them room to stand out. They appeal to someone who enjoys expressive accessories and does not want jewellery to be subtle.$desc$ WHERE id = 29;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Soft slip-on slippers combining black and brown tones, with a cushioned footbed made for standing and moving around indoors. They fit home life, hotel rooms and relaxed evenings, and they slide on and off without effort. Worn with loungewear, pyjamas or casual home clothes, they keep comfort as the whole point. The mood is quiet, warm and restful.$desc$ WHERE id = 30;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Sleek heeled shoes with a clean silhouette and a smooth finish, designed for occasions that call for a proper shoe. They work for formal events, business meetings, evening dinners and weddings, lengthening the leg under trousers or a dress. They pair well with tailoring, midi dresses and evening gowns, and the restrained design keeps the outfit coherent. The style is sophisticated, minimal and classically feminine.$desc$ WHERE id = 31;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Golden shoes with a metallic finish that catches light, meant for the moments worth dressing up for. They suit parties, weddings, New Year celebrations and evening events where a bit of shine is welcome. Black, navy or neutral clothing lets them lead, and they replace the need for much other jewellery. The mood is glamorous, festive and openly celebratory.$desc$ WHERE id = 32;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Everyday shoes with a soft upper and a comfortable flat sole, built for the ordinary distances of a normal day. They fit errands, work-from-anywhere days, travel and casual meetups, and they stay wearable across most of the year. Jeans, casual trousers and simple dresses all sit easily with them. The character is relaxed, practical and undemanding.$desc$ WHERE id = 33;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Shoes in a strong red that act as the accent of an outfit rather than a background detail. They lift a plain look for parties, dinners, dates and days when something brighter feels right. Black, white, denim and neutral clothing keep the balance so the colour does not compete. The feeling is bold, playful and self-assured.$desc$ WHERE id = 34;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A stainless steel watch with a solid case and an automatic movement, built with the durability of an engineering-minded design. It works across daily wear, the office and active weekends without needing to be treated carefully. Worn with tailoring, knitwear or casual clothing, it reads as a considered choice rather than an ornament. It suits someone who wants a serious mechanical watch instead of a delicate one.$desc$ WHERE id = 35;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A dress watch with a moon phase complication, where the small detail on the dial adds craft to an otherwise clean and elegant face. It belongs with formal wear — evenings, celebrations, milestone occasions — and carries the weight of a meaningful gift. It sits neatly beneath a cuff and works alongside fine jewellery rather than competing with it. The character is refined, traditional and made for someone who appreciates the mechanics.$desc$ WHERE id = 36;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A classic bracelet watch with a date window, scaled and proportioned for a woman's wrist. It moves between office days, dinners and formal occasions without any adjustment, which makes it a strong single-watch choice. The metal bracelet works with tailoring, dresses and casual clothing alike, and it layers comfortably with a thin bracelet. The overall impression is timeless, elegant and practical at the same time.$desc$ WHERE id = 37;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A gold-toned watch with a slim case and a polished finish, functioning as much as jewellery as it does as a timepiece. It suits evenings, weddings, celebrations and dressed-up daytime occasions, and it makes a natural gift. It layers well with gold bracelets and rings, and it warms up black, cream and neutral clothing. The feeling is glamorous, feminine and celebratory.$desc$ WHERE id = 38;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$An everyday wrist watch with a simple dial and a comfortable strap, made to be put on without thinking about it. It fits work, study, errands and casual plans, and it stays appropriate if the day turns into something more formal. It works with almost any style of clothing and does not demand matching jewellery. The character is understated, easy and genuinely versatile.$desc$ WHERE id = 39;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A blue dress in a smooth, lightly flowing fabric that moves easily and keeps its shape through a long day. It fits celebrations, family gatherings, dinners and spring or summer occasions that ask for something a little dressed. Heeled sandals or flats work depending on the setting, and a light cardigan or jacket carries it into cooler evenings. The mood is charming, feminine and pleasantly polished.$desc$ WHERE id = 40;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A light summer dress for women in a breathable printed fabric, cut to stay cool through hot weather. It suits holidays, beach days, brunches and warm evenings out, and it packs easily for travel. Sandals, sneakers or espadrilles keep it casual, while a straw bag and sunglasses complete the summer look. The vibe is breezy, cheerful and relaxed.$desc$ WHERE id = 41;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A grey dress in a neutral, mid-weight fabric that can be pushed in either direction depending on what it is worn with. Flats and a cardigan make it an office or everyday dress; heels and jewellery turn it into evening wear. It layers well under coats and blazers, which keeps it useful from autumn through spring. The character is understated, adaptable and reliably tasteful.$desc$ WHERE id = 42;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A short dress with a light, easy-moving fabric and a playful cut that suits younger, more relaxed occasions. It fits parties, birthdays, dates and casual summer outings where comfort and movement matter. Sneakers or flat sandals keep it daytime, while heels and a small bag lift it for the evening. The feeling is fun, youthful and confident.$desc$ WHERE id = 43;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$A dress in a woven tartan check with the slightly heavier, warmer handle that suits autumn and winter. It works for holidays, family gatherings, Christmas occasions and colder-weather days out, layering well over tights and under a wool coat. Boots and a simple knit complete it without fighting the pattern. The mood is traditional, seasonal and quietly sophisticated.$desc$ WHERE id = 44;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Sunglasses with a sleek black frame and tinted lenses that cut glare while keeping the whole look simple. They suit driving, beach days, travel and bright city walks, and they carry through the year rather than only in summer. The black frame goes with anything, which is exactly the point — no coordination required. The character is classic, versatile and easy to reach for.$desc$ WHERE id = 45;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Sunglasses with a neutral frame and UV-protected lenses, built around a shape that has stayed in style for decades. They fit everyday errands, holidays, outdoor work and long drives without looking out of place in any of them. The muted frame colour blends with both casual and smarter clothing. The feeling is timeless and low-key rather than fashion-led.$desc$ WHERE id = 46;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Sunglasses combining a green frame with black detailing, giving a bit of colour to an accessory that is usually kept plain. They suit festivals, holidays, summer weekends and anyone who enjoys eyewear as part of the outfit. Plain clothing in neutral tones lets the frame stand out clearly. The mood is bold, eye-catching and a little bit expressive.$desc$ WHERE id = 47;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Novelty glasses with unusual shapes and bright frames, made to add a bit of humour to a celebration. They belong at parties, birthdays, festivals and themed nights rather than in everyday wear. They work with whatever the occasion already calls for, and they photograph well in a group. The character is playful, silly and entirely about having a good time.$desc$ WHERE id = 48;
UPDATE products SET rich_description = $desc$Sunglasses with a plain frame and straightforward tinted lenses, focused on doing the job rather than making a statement. They handle sun, driving, walking and outdoor time without asking for any thought about styling. The simple shape works with casual clothes, sportswear and smarter outfits alike. The impression is functional, unpretentious and quietly classic.$desc$ WHERE id = 49;
